%% Used in chapters/04-350z-buyers-guide.md — shopping/decision flowchart
flowchart TD
    A[Find a listing] --> B{Seller answers questions in writing?}
    B -- No --> Z[Move on]
    B -- Yes --> C{VIN checks out - year, history, title?}
    C -- No --> Z
    C -- Yes --> D{Walk-around video looks clean?}
    D -- No --> Z
    D -- Yes --> E[Schedule an in-person look + PPI]
    E --> F{Passes Inspection Checklist?}
    F -- No, minor issues --> G[Renegotiate price to cover fixes]
    F -- No, major issues --> Z
    F -- Yes --> H[Proceed to purchase]
    G --> H
